# Shell scripts get deployed straight onto OpenWrt devices (see
# app/device_client.py's provisioning flow, or a plain scp) and run
# under busybox ash there - CRLF line endings are fragile at best there
# (shebang lines in particular can break). Force LF regardless of the
# checking-out machine's core.autocrlf setting - discovered live
# 2026-08-01 when a Windows checkout's CRLF-converted wifi-agent.sh got
# pushed to a real device via scp.
agent/*.sh text eol=lf
agent/*.init text eol=lf
